<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span> <span id="alg2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Inference Procedure of CBD</span></figcaption>
<div id="alg2.6" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg2.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
