="0.700em" minsize="0.700em">)</mo></mrow><mo fence="false" maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="true">|</mo><msup><mo fence="false" maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em" stretchy="true">|</mo><mn mathsize="0.700em">2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boldsymbol{\tilde{s}}^{\prime}_{t+1}\leftarrow\boldsymbol{\tilde{s}}_{t+1:T}-\lambda\nabla_{\boldsymbol{\tilde{s}}_{t+1:T}}||R_{\varphi}(\boldsymbol{\tilde{x}}_{0}(\tau,t))||^{2}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">
</span>
</div>
